{"schema":"rebang.page/1","platform":"jike","key":"h-310821531c","page":1,"pages":1,"total":10,"has_more":false,"items":[{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b030290136b2761c686b45e","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"三体都 20 年了啊？？啊？ 所以柜子里的书也有 20 年了？","body":"三体都 20 年了啊？？啊？\n\n所以柜子里的书也有 20 年了？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b030290136b2761c686b45e","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lvOPa0LHutZFBDkSJUVGH19R_cK4v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:56:16+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:08:11+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lvOPa0LHutZFBDkSJUVGH19R_cK4v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b029da4136b2761c67bdf4b","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"有人对步行模拟器感兴趣么？","body":"有人对步行模拟器感兴趣么？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b029da4136b2761c67bdf4b","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-22T15:45:40+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:08:11+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/reposts/6b01443d3ce945612ee95023","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"牛(¯▽¯)👍","body":"牛(¯▽¯)👍","url":"https://m.okjike.com/reposts/6b01443d3ce945612ee95023","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FiF-GClcuLArV6eVUbPk5ebDup-Av3.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/thumbnail/300x2000%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T15:11:57+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:08:11+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FiF-GClcuLArV6eVUbPk5ebDup-Av3.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/thumbnail/300x2000%3E"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Frj7Radr5k-geeDRZWEgHJT5zHYlv3.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/thumbnail/300x2000%3E"}],"quote":{"handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","text":"一直有品牌方朋友在问老节目能不能植入，目前 166 个老节目坑位全部开放，欢迎品牌方朋友垂询。\n\n也算是替播客主播朋友们探索一下新的商业模式。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/users/BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF"},"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdb5393ce945612e87fd7e","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"偶然看到： 麦子自秦朝以来，也就成熟了 2000 多次。","body":"偶然看到：\n\n麦子自秦朝以来，也就成熟了 2000 多次。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdb5393ce945612e87fd7e","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/LPFj0ovo2Ss9glUcOFqh--POlA3EZl.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T22:24:57+08:00","